#. module: zd_goods_in_transit
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_zd_goods_in_transit
msgid ""
"\n"
"Posts sale-order deliveries of real-time-valued products to a Goods in Transit\n"
"account (Dr Goods in Transit / Cr Stock Valuation), routes invoice COGS through\n"
"transit (Dr COGS / Cr Goods in Transit), and reverses both on returns and credit\n"
"notes. Periodic-valuation products and native stock valuation are unchanged.\n"
msgstr ""
"将 real_time（永续/开票时结转）估值的销售订单交货记入发出商品科目"
"（借 发出商品 / 贷 库存商品），发票 COGS 通过发出商品结转"
"（借 销售成本 / 贷 发出商品），退货和红冲做反向处理。"
"periodic 产品与原生库存估值逻辑不变。\n"

#. module: zd_goods_in_transit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:zd_goods_in_transit.field_product_category__property_stock_account_transit_id
msgid ""
"Account holding the cost of goods delivered to customers but not yet "
"invoiced. Used for sale-order deliveries and for the COGS of real-time-"
"valued products. Leave empty to use the company default."
msgstr ""
"用于归集已交付给客户但尚未开票的商品成本。适用于销售订单交货及"
"real_time 估值产品的 COGS。留空时使用公司默认值。"

